        Protocol used by the intranet application. If protocol is set to BOTH, TCP and UDP traffic is allowed. Possible values = TCP, UDP, ANY
    .PARAMETER Spoofiip
        IP address that the intranet application will use to route the connection through the virtual adapter. Default value: ON Possible values = ON, OFF
    .PARAMETER Srcip
        Source IP address. Required if interception mode is set to PROXY. Default is the loopback address, 127.0.0.1. Minimum length = 1
    .PARAMETER SrcPort
